WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.930
In many Hindu temples, a
curtain opens at set times,

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.150
and worshippers gather to look.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.010
Inside the shrine, the sacred
image has large, prominent eyes.

4
00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.290
A lamp is waved in circles.

5
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.520
Worshippers pass their
palms over the flame.

6
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.590
Why does seeing the deity matter so much,

7
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.870
and why does being seen
matter just as much?

8
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.600
In this mission, you'll follow
worship at a family shrine at home,

9
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.030
and in the temple.

10
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.460
Then you'll walk the
path around the shrine,

11
00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.640
and find out what happens
to food that is offered.

12
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.340
Your mission: find out why
seeing, and being seen,

13
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:39.550
sit at the heart of Hindu worship.
